 'PDF p. 6, item 6.2 prints "Level landings/ resting areas provided at 9m/10yd intervals along ramp" in blue. Comparator <=: "provided at 9m intervals" sets the longest run between landings, a ceiling on the run; the source does not print "maximum". Lens: access need A-EFFORT (design obligation "Cost little energy; ... rest points") on the source''s words "resting areas". [ASSUMPTION] the judge''s reading that "Level landings/ resting areas" names the resting function and not merely a feature; the rule applied across this batch is that the words must name the function or need. No identity is named (OD-31); no ICF code is linked, because the registry''s b455 carries no title to read a warrant against.', '2026-11-13 23:00', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', '2026-11-13 23:00', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', 'claim', '<=', 0, NULL);
