son), checked on the render', 'full-read', 'absent-confirmed', NULL, 'PDF p. 3, item 2.4 prints "Door operating device should not require tight grasping or twisting of the wrist (doors should have lever handles)" in blue: a grip and wrist requirement with no force figure, so the source states nothing for parameter 6 operating force. Lens: ICF d440 "Fine hand use" (the words "tight grasping") and d445 "Hand and arm use" (the words "twisting of the wrist"), on the clause''s own words. No access-need link: no design obligation in access_needs names grip or wrist movement (A-PRECISION names imprecise input, A-REACH reach and one-handed operation). No identity is named.', '2026-11-13 23:00', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', '2026-11-13 23:00', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', 'finding', NULL, 0, NULL);
