ider doors are required by many wheelchairs and scooters today", which names exactly door width and turning space: MOB for the wheelchair and scooter users it names; A-REACH because that need''s design obligation names "doorway/turning clearance" and it absorbs wheelchair users; d465 "Moving around using equipment" because the sentence names wheelchairs and scooters. [ASSUMPTION] that a page-1 sentence naming these two quantities warrants their figures elsewhere in the document; a stricter reading of the lens writer''s D-2 rule (the figure''s own words) would move them under the owner''s open question OD-47.', '2026-11-13 23:00', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', '2026-11-13 23:00', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', 'finding', NULL, 1, NULL);
