 contrasting colour on the back of the stairwell above the tactile strips to alert a potential safety hazard"; item 6.5 "(able to open doors without backing onto ramp)"; item 8.2 "so persons who are blind do not become disoriented"; item 8.5 "insulate any exposed pipes"; item 8.6 "toilet paper reachable without leaning too far off toilet"; item 11.2 "grey colours should be avoided as they blend into the general background". Each is held as an observation; one gap names them.', 1, 'No prior: no search was run. The owner supplied this document; the field is recorded after the document was read and is not a forecast.', 'owner-supplied', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-13 23:00', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
